#: ../../library/pyb.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`pyb` --- functions related to the board"
msgstr ":mod:`pyb` --- fungsi-fungsi terkait papan"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:9
msgid ""
"**The pyb module is deprecated.** Use the cross-port :mod:`machine` module "
"for new code -- it provides the same functionality on every OpenMV Cam "
"regardless of MCU family, whereas ``pyb`` exists only on the STM32-based "
"boards. ``pyb`` is retained for backwards compatibility with older scripts, "
"no new features will be added, and it may be removed in a future release."
msgstr ""
"**Modul pyb sudah usang.** Gunakan modul lintas-port :mod:`machine` untuk "
"kode baru -- modul ini menyediakan fungsionalitas yang sama di setiap OpenMV"
" Cam terlepas dari keluarga MCU, sedangkan ``pyb`` hanya tersedia di papan "
"berbasis STM32. ``pyb`` dipertahankan untuk kompatibilitas mundur dengan "
"skrip lama, tidak ada fitur baru yang akan ditambahkan, dan mungkin akan "
"dihapus di rilis mendatang."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:16
msgid ""
"The ``pyb`` module contains STM32-specific functions related to the board."
msgstr ""
"Modul ``pyb`` berisi fungsi-fungsi khusus STM32 yang terkait dengan papan."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:19
msgid "Time related functions"
msgstr "Fungsi terkait waktu"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:23
msgid "Delay for the given number of milliseconds."
msgstr "Tunda selama jumlah milidetik yang ditentukan."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:27
msgid "Delay for the given number of microseconds."
msgstr "Tunda selama jumlah mikrodetik yang ditentukan."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:31
msgid "Returns the number of milliseconds since the board was last reset."
msgstr "Mengembalikan jumlah milidetik sejak papan terakhir direset."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:33
msgid ""
"The result is always a MicroPython smallint (31-bit signed number), so after"
" 2^30 milliseconds (about 12.4 days) this will start to return negative "
"numbers."
msgstr ""
"Hasilnya selalu berupa MicroPython smallint (bilangan bertanda 31-bit), "
"sehingga setelah 2^30 milidetik (sekitar 12,4 hari) fungsi ini akan mulai "
"mengembalikan bilangan negatif."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:37
msgid ""
"Note that if :meth:`pyb.stop()` is issued the hardware counter supporting "
"this function will pause for the duration of the \"sleeping\" state. This "
"will affect the outcome of :meth:`pyb.elapsed_millis()`."
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa jika :meth:`pyb.stop()` dipanggil, penghitung perangkat "
"keras yang mendukung fungsi ini akan berhenti selama durasi status "
"\"tidur\". Ini akan mempengaruhi hasil :meth:`pyb.elapsed_millis()`\\ ."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:43
msgid "Returns the number of microseconds since the board was last reset."
msgstr "Mengembalikan jumlah mikrodetik sejak papan terakhir direset."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:45
msgid ""
"The result is always a MicroPython smallint (31-bit signed number), so after"
" 2^30 microseconds (about 17.8 minutes) this will start to return negative "
"numbers."
msgstr ""
"Hasilnya selalu berupa MicroPython smallint (bilangan bertanda 31-bit), "
"sehingga setelah 2^30 mikrodetik (sekitar 17,8 menit) fungsi ini akan mulai "
"mengembalikan bilangan negatif."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:49
msgid ""
"Note that if :meth:`pyb.stop()` is issued the hardware counter supporting "
"this function will pause for the duration of the \"sleeping\" state. This "
"will affect the outcome of :meth:`pyb.elapsed_micros()`."
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa jika :meth:`pyb.stop()` dipanggil, penghitung perangkat "
"keras yang mendukung fungsi ini akan berhenti selama durasi status "
"\"tidur\". Ini akan mempengaruhi hasil :meth:`pyb.elapsed_micros()`\\ ."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:55
msgid "Returns the number of milliseconds which have elapsed since ``start``."
msgstr "Mengembalikan jumlah milidetik yang telah berlalu sejak ``start``\\ ."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:57
msgid ""
"This function takes care of counter wrap, and always returns a positive "
"number. This means it can be used to measure periods up to about 12.4 days."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi ini menangani wrap penghitung, dan selalu mengembalikan bilangan "
"positif. Artinya, fungsi ini dapat digunakan untuk mengukur periode hingga "
"sekitar 12,4 hari."

