#: ../../library/pyb.rst:81
msgid "Reset related functions"
msgstr "Fungsi terkait reset"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:85
msgid ""
"Resets the OpenMV Cam in a manner similar to pushing the external RESET "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Mereset OpenMV Cam dengan cara yang mirip dengan menekan tombol RESET "
"eksternal."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:90
msgid ""
"Reset into OpenMV's own USB DFU bootloader, ready for a firmware update. "
"This is the recommended way to invoke DFU from running code -- no BOOT pin "
"needs to be asserted at reset."
msgstr ""
"Reset ke bootloader USB DFU milik OpenMV sendiri, siap untuk pembaruan "
"firmware. Ini adalah cara yang direkomendasikan untuk memicu DFU dari kode "
"yang sedang berjalan -- tidak perlu menegaskan pin BOOT saat reset."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:94
msgid ""
"Not available on the OpenMV Cam N6 (the ``pyb`` legacy compatibility layer "
"is disabled on that board); use :func:`machine.bootloader` instead."
msgstr ""
"Tidak tersedia di OpenMV Cam N6 (lapisan kompatibilitas lama ``pyb`` "
"dinonaktifkan di papan tersebut); gunakan :func:`machine.bootloader` sebagai"
" gantinya."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:100
msgid ""
"Enable or disable hard-fault debugging.  A hard-fault is when there is a "
"fatal error in the underlying system, like an invalid memory access."
msgstr ""
"Mengaktifkan atau menonaktifkan debug hard-fault. Hard-fault terjadi ketika "
"ada kesalahan fatal di sistem yang mendasarinya, seperti akses memori yang "
"tidak valid."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:103
msgid ""
"If the *value* argument is ``False`` then the board will automatically reset"
" if there is a hard fault."
msgstr ""
"Jika argumen *value* adalah ``False`` maka papan akan otomatis direset jika "
"terjadi hard fault."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:106
msgid ""
"If *value* is ``True`` then, when the board has a hard fault, it will print "
"the registers and the stack trace, and then cycle the LEDs indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"Jika *value* adalah ``True`` maka, ketika papan mengalami hard fault, papan "
"akan mencetak register dan stack trace, kemudian menggilir LED tanpa batas."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:109
msgid "The default value is disabled, i.e. to automatically reset."
msgstr "Nilai default dinonaktifkan, yaitu untuk reset otomatis."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:112
msgid "Interrupt related functions"
msgstr "Fungsi terkait interupsi"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:116
msgid ""
"Disable interrupt requests. Returns the previous IRQ state: "
"``False``/``True`` for disabled/enabled IRQs respectively.  This return "
"value can be passed to enable_irq to restore the IRQ to its original state."
msgstr ""
"Menonaktifkan permintaan interupsi. Mengembalikan status IRQ sebelumnya: "
"``False``\\ /\\ ``True`` untuk IRQ yang dinonaktifkan/diaktifkan. Nilai "
"kembalian ini dapat diteruskan ke enable_irq untuk memulihkan IRQ ke status "
"aslinya."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:123
msgid ""
"Enable interrupt requests. If ``state`` is ``True`` (the default value) then"
" IRQs are enabled. If ``state`` is ``False`` then IRQs are disabled.  The "
"most common use of this function is to pass it the value returned by "
"``disable_irq`` to exit a critical section."
msgstr ""
"Mengaktifkan permintaan interupsi. Jika ``state`` adalah ``True`` (nilai "
"default) maka IRQ diaktifkan. Jika ``state`` adalah ``False`` maka IRQ "
"dinonaktifkan. Penggunaan paling umum dari fungsi ini adalah meneruskan "
"nilai yang dikembalikan oleh ``disable_irq`` untuk keluar dari bagian "
"kritis."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:131
msgid ""
"If given no arguments, returns a tuple of clock frequencies ``(sysclk, hclk,"
" pclk1, pclk2)`` in hertz:"
msgstr ""
"Jika dipanggil tanpa argumen, mengembalikan tuple frekuensi clock ``(sysclk,"
" hclk, pclk1, pclk2)`` dalam hertz:"

