msgstr "Makna"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:140
msgid "``sysclk``"
msgstr "``sysclk``"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:141
msgid "CPU frequency"
msgstr "Frekuensi CPU"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:142
msgid "``hclk``"
msgstr "``hclk``"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:143
msgid "AHB bus, core memory and DMA frequency"
msgstr "Bus AHB, memori inti dan frekuensi DMA"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:144
msgid "``pclk1``"
msgstr "``pclk1``"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:145
msgid "APB1 bus frequency"
msgstr "Frekuensi bus APB1"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:146
msgid "``pclk2``"
msgstr "``pclk2``"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:147
msgid "APB2 bus frequency"
msgstr "Frekuensi bus APB2"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:149
msgid ""
"If given any arguments then the function sets the CPU frequency (and bus "
"frequencies if additional arguments are supplied). Frequencies are in hertz;"
" the largest supported frequency not greater than the given value is "
"selected. The set of valid ``sysclk`` frequencies and the maximum ``hclk`` /"
" ``pclk1`` / ``pclk2`` values depend on the MCU -- refer to the relevant "
"STM32 reference manual for the OpenMV Cam in use. The bus frequencies are "
"derived from ``sysclk`` via prescalers the driver picks to best match the "
"requested values."
msgstr ""
"Jika diberi argumen apa pun, fungsi ini mengatur frekuensi CPU (dan "
"frekuensi bus jika argumen tambahan diberikan). Frekuensi dalam hertz; "
"frekuensi terbesar yang didukung yang tidak melebihi nilai yang diberikan "
"dipilih. Kumpulan frekuensi ``sysclk`` yang valid dan nilai maksimum "
"``hclk`` / ``pclk1`` / ``pclk2`` bergantung pada MCU -- lihat manual "
"referensi STM32 yang relevan untuk OpenMV Cam yang digunakan. Frekuensi bus "
"diturunkan dari ``sysclk`` melalui prescaler yang dipilih driver untuk "
"paling cocok dengan nilai yang diminta."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:160
msgid ""
"Changing the frequency while USB is enabled may make USB unreliable. Change "
"it from :ref:`boot.py`, before the USB peripheral is started, and do not "
"select a ``sysclk`` value too low for the USB clock requirements of the MCU."
msgstr ""
"Mengubah frekuensi saat USB diaktifkan dapat membuat USB tidak stabil. Ubah "
"dari :ref:`boot.py`\\ , sebelum periferal USB dimulai, dan jangan pilih "
"nilai ``sysclk`` yang terlalu rendah untuk persyaratan clock USB dari MCU."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:166
msgid "Power related functions"
msgstr "Fungsi terkait daya"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:170
msgid "Wait for an internal or external interrupt."
msgstr "Tunggu interupsi internal atau eksternal."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:172
msgid ""
"This executes a ``wfi`` instruction which reduces power consumption of the "
"MCU until any interrupt occurs (be it internal or external), at which point "
"execution continues.  Note that the system-tick interrupt occurs once every "
"millisecond (1000Hz) so this function will block for at most 1ms."
msgstr ""
"Ini menjalankan instruksi ``wfi`` yang mengurangi konsumsi daya MCU hingga "
"interupsi apa pun terjadi (baik internal maupun eksternal), di mana titik "
"eksekusi dilanjutkan. Perhatikan bahwa interupsi system-tick terjadi sekali "
"setiap milidetik (1000Hz) sehingga fungsi ini akan memblokir paling lama "
"1ms."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:180
msgid ""
"Put the OpenMV Cam into the STM32 *stop* low-power state. Execution "
"continues from this point on wake-up. Wake-up requires an external interrupt"
" or a real-time-clock event; see :meth:`pyb.RTC.wakeup` to configure one. "
"The exact achievable current draw depends on the board and on which "
"peripherals are left clocked."
msgstr ""
"Menempatkan OpenMV Cam ke status daya rendah *stop* STM32. Eksekusi "
"dilanjutkan dari titik ini saat bangun. Bangun memerlukan interupsi "
"eksternal atau peristiwa real-time-clock; lihat :meth:`pyb.RTC.wakeup` untuk"
" mengonfigurasinya. Konsumsi arus yang dapat dicapai bergantung pada papan "
"dan periferal mana yang tetap diberi clock."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:188
msgid ""
"Put the OpenMV Cam into the STM32 *standby* deep-sleep state. This is the "
"lowest power-down level; the device exits via a hard reset when woken, so "
"execution does not resume in place. Wake-up requires a real-time-clock "
"event; see :meth:`pyb.RTC.wakeup` to configure one. The exact achievable "
"current draw depends on the board."
msgstr ""
"Menempatkan OpenMV Cam ke status tidur-dalam *standby* STM32. Ini adalah "
"level penurunan daya terendah; perangkat keluar melalui hard reset saat "
"dibangunkan, sehingga eksekusi tidak dilanjutkan di tempat yang sama. Bangun"
" memerlukan peristiwa real-time-clock; lihat :meth:`pyb.RTC.wakeup` untuk "
"mengonfigurasinya. Konsumsi arus yang dapat dicapai bergantung pada papan."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:195
msgid "Miscellaneous functions"
msgstr "Fungsi lain-lain"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:199
msgid "Return True if USB is connected as a serial device, False otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Mengembalikan True jika USB terhubung sebagai perangkat serial, False jika "
"tidak."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:201
msgid "This function is deprecated.  Use pyb.USB_VCP().isconnected() instead."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi ini sudah usang. Gunakan pyb.USB_VCP().isconnected() sebagai "
"gantinya."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:205
msgid ""
"Takes a 4-tuple (or list) and sends it to the USB host (the PC) to signal a "
"HID mouse-motion event."
msgstr ""
"Mengambil 4-tuple (atau daftar) dan mengirimkannya ke host USB (PC) untuk "
"memberi sinyal peristiwa gerakan mouse HID."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:208
msgid "This function is deprecated.  Use :meth:`pyb.USB_HID.send()` instead."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi ini sudah usang. Gunakan :meth:`pyb.USB_HID.send()` sebagai gantinya."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:212
msgid "Print out lots of information about the board."
msgstr "Mencetak banyak informasi tentang papan."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:216
msgid ""
"Set the filename of the main script to run after :ref:`boot.py` is finished."
" If this function is not called then the default file :ref:`main.py` will be"
" executed."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur nama file skrip utama yang akan dijalankan setelah :ref:`boot.py` "
"selesai. Jika fungsi ini tidak dipanggil maka file default :ref:`main.py` "
"akan dieksekusi."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:220
msgid "It only makes sense to call this function from within boot.py."
msgstr "Hanya masuk akal untuk memanggil fungsi ini dari dalam boot.py."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:226
msgid ""
"This function is deprecated. Use :func:`vfs.mount` / :func:`vfs.umount` and "
"a :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev`-derived block device instead."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi ini sudah usang. Gunakan :func:`vfs.mount` / :func:`vfs.umount` dan "
"perangkat blok turunan :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` sebagai gantinya."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:229
msgid ""
"Mount a block device under ``mountpoint``. ``device`` must implement the "
"legacy pyb block-device protocol (also deprecated -- see "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` for the modern interface):"
msgstr ""
"Memasang perangkat blok di bawah ``mountpoint``\\ . ``device`` harus "
"mengimplementasikan protokol perangkat blok pyb lama (juga sudah usang -- "
"lihat :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` untuk antarmuka modern):"

