msgid "``count(self)``"
msgstr "``count(self)``"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:246
msgid "Return the number of 512-byte blocks on the device."
msgstr "Mengembalikan jumlah blok 512-byte pada perangkat."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:247
msgid "``sync(self)`` *(optional)*"
msgstr "``sync(self)`` *(opsional)*"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:248
msgid "Flush any cached writes."
msgstr "Membuang semua tulisan yang di-cache."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:250
msgid ""
"``mountpoint`` is the path in the root of the filesystem to mount the device"
" at; it must begin with a forward slash. ``readonly`` forces a read-only "
"mount. ``mkfs`` creates a new filesystem if none is present."
msgstr ""
"``mountpoint`` adalah jalur di root sistem file untuk memasang perangkat; "
"harus dimulai dengan garis miring. ``readonly`` memaksa pemasangan hanya-"
"baca. ``mkfs`` membuat sistem file baru jika tidak ada."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:256
msgid "Get or set the UART object where the REPL is repeated on."
msgstr "Mendapatkan atau mengatur objek UART tempat REPL diulangi."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:260
msgid "Return a 30-bit hardware generated random number."
msgstr "Mengembalikan bilangan acak 30-bit yang dihasilkan perangkat keras."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:264
msgid "Sync all file systems."
msgstr "Sinkronisasi semua sistem file."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:268
msgid ""
"Returns a string of 12 bytes (96 bits), which is the unique ID of the MCU."
msgstr "Mengembalikan string 12 byte (96 bit), yang merupakan ID unik MCU."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:272
msgid "If called with no arguments, return the current USB mode as a string."
msgstr ""
"Jika dipanggil tanpa argumen, mengembalikan mode USB saat ini sebagai "
"string."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:274
msgid ""
"If called with *modestr* provided, attempts to configure the USB mode. The "
"following values of *modestr* are understood:"
msgstr ""
"Jika dipanggil dengan *modestr* yang diberikan, mencoba mengonfigurasi mode "
"USB. Nilai-nilai *modestr* berikut dipahami:"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:281
msgid "*modestr*"
msgstr "*modestr*"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:282
msgid "Configures"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:283
msgid "``None``"
msgstr "``None``"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:284
msgid "Disables USB."
msgstr "Menonaktifkan USB."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:285
msgid "``'VCP'``"
msgstr "``'VCP'``"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:286
msgid "VCP (Virtual COM Port) only."
msgstr "Hanya VCP (Virtual COM Port)."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:287
msgid "``'MSC'``"
msgstr "``'MSC'``"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:288
msgid "MSC (USB mass storage class) only."
msgstr "Hanya MSC (kelas penyimpanan massal USB)."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:289
msgid "``'VCP+MSC'``"
msgstr "``'VCP+MSC'``"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:290
msgid "VCP and MSC."
msgstr "VCP dan MSC."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:291
msgid "``'VCP+HID'``"
msgstr "``'VCP+HID'``"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:292
msgid "VCP and HID (human interface device)."
msgstr "VCP dan HID (perangkat antarmuka manusia)."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:293
msgid "``'VCP+MSC+HID'``"
msgstr "``'VCP+MSC+HID'``"

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:294
msgid "VCP, MSC and HID together. Not supported on every OpenMV Cam."
msgstr "VCP, MSC dan HID bersama-sama. Tidak didukung di setiap OpenMV Cam."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:296
msgid ""
"For backwards compatibility, ``'CDC'`` is understood to mean ``'VCP'`` (and "
"similarly for ``'CDC+MSC'`` and ``'CDC+HID'``)."
msgstr ""
"Untuk kompatibilitas mundur, ``'CDC'`` dipahami berarti ``'VCP'`` (dan juga "
"untuk ``'CDC+MSC'`` dan ``'CDC+HID'``\\ )."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:299
msgid ""
"The *port* parameter should be an integer (0, 1, ...) and selects which USB "
"port to use if the board supports multiple ports.  A value of -1 uses the "
"default or automatically selected port."
msgstr ""
"Parameter *port* harus berupa integer (0, 1, ...) dan memilih port USB mana "
"yang akan digunakan jika papan mendukung beberapa port. Nilai -1 menggunakan"
" port default atau yang dipilih secara otomatis."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:303
msgid ""
"The *vid* and *pid* parameters allow you to specify the VID (vendor id) and "
"PID (product id).  A *pid* value of -1 will select a PID based on the value "
"of *modestr*."
msgstr ""
"Parameter *vid* dan *pid* memungkinkan Anda menentukan VID (vendor id) dan "
"PID (product id). Nilai *pid* sebesar -1 akan memilih PID berdasarkan nilai "
"*modestr*\\ ."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:307
msgid ""
"If enabling MSC mode, the *msc* parameter can be used to specify a list of "
"SCSI LUNs to expose on the mass storage interface.  For example "
"``msc=(pyb.Flash(), pyb.SDCard())``."
msgstr ""
"Jika mengaktifkan mode MSC, parameter *msc* dapat digunakan untuk menentukan"
" daftar SCSI LUN yang akan diekspos pada antarmuka penyimpanan massal. "
"Misalnya ``msc=(pyb.Flash(), pyb.SDCard())``\\ ."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:311
msgid ""
"If enabling HID mode, you may also specify the HID details by passing the "
"*hid* keyword parameter.  It takes a tuple of (subclass, protocol, max "
"packet length, polling interval, report descriptor).  By default it will set"
" appropriate values for a USB mouse.  There is also a ``pyb.hid_keyboard`` "
"constant, which is an appropriate tuple for a USB keyboard."
msgstr ""
"Jika mengaktifkan mode HID, Anda juga dapat menentukan detail HID dengan "
"meneruskan parameter kata kunci *hid*\\ . Parameter ini mengambil tuple "
"(subclass, protocol, max packet length, polling interval, report "
"descriptor). Secara default, ini akan mengatur nilai yang sesuai untuk mouse"
" USB. Ada juga konstanta ``pyb.hid_keyboard``\\ , yang merupakan tuple yang "
"sesuai untuk keyboard USB."

#: ../../library/pyb.rst:318
msgid ""
"The *high_speed* parameter, when set to ``True``, enables USB HS mode if it "
"is supported by the hardware."
msgstr ""
"Parameter *high_speed*\\ , ketika diatur ke ``True``\\ , mengaktifkan mode "
"USB HS jika didukung oleh perangkat keras."

